{"articleNo":"124144","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=124144&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2015학년도 편입생 학점인정내역 및 이의신청기간 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.02.28","hit":"4203","attachments":[{"name":"편입생 학점인정 변경신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=124144&attachNo=4136"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2015학년도&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #000080; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">편입생</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">에 대한</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #000080; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 학점인정내역</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">을 아래와 같이 알려드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#3d0099\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffb2d9\">1. <strong>편입생 학점인정내역 조회</strong></font></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"+0\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffb2d9\" color=\"#3d0099\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 원스톱서비스-학사관리-성적-편입생학점인정내역</span></strong></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>2. 이의 신청</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가) </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">본인의 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학점인정내역을 확인</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">한 후 이의사항이 있을 경우,</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나) </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">편입생 학점인정 변경신청서를 작성하여,</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 다) </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3월 10일(화)까지 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">이의 신청</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 전공, MSC : 해당 학부(과)로 이의 신청</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 교양 : 교양교직과정부로 이의 신청(478-7797)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라) 편입학자는 학점인정을 통보 받은 후 7일 이내에 이의를 제기할 수 있으며, </span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -241.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 241.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 그 사유가 타당하다고 인정될 경우 정정될 수 있습니다.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
